{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM/pulls/375","id":4024153894,"node_id":"PR_kwDON43Ikc7v27cm","html_url":"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM/pull/375","diff_url":"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM/pull/375.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM/pull/375.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM/issues/375","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM/pulls/375/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM/pulls/375/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM/issues/375/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/deepseek-ai/DeepGEMM/statuses/4e4e54036becc2a1ee9b5470015566673045acfd","number":375,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix non-deterministic results in k_grouped_fp8_gemm_nt_contiguous","user":{"login":"Functionhx","id":172989722,"node_id":"U_kgDOCk-dGg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172989722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx","html_url":"https://github.com/Functionhx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\nFixes #365: non-deterministic numerical results in FP8 grouped GEMM when one expert has exactly 128 tokens.\n\n## Root Cause\n\nRace condition in sm90_fp8_gemm_1d1d.cuh: tensormap.replace operations and in-flight TMA data loads were in the same cp.async.bulk commit group. Per PTX ISA, operations within a commit group may complete in any order, allowing descriptor modifications to become visible before pending TMA reads complete.\n\n## Fix\n\nRestructure group-switch into three phases:\n1. Drain: commit_group + wait_group all pending TMA data operations\n2. Modify + Fence: issue tensormap.replace, then commit_group + wait_group in a separate group\n3. Publish: copy updated descriptors to global memory, release_gpu + acquire_gpu","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-09T18:24:34Z","updated_at":"2026-08-28T12:32:09Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Functionhx:fix/fp8-gemm-nondeterministic","ref":"fix/fp8-gemm-nondeterministic","repo":{"id":1295599332,"node_id":"R_kgDOTTlG5A","name":"DeepGEMM","full_name":"Functionhx/DeepGEMM","owner":{"login":"Functionhx","id":172989722,"node_id":"U_kgDOCk-dGg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172989722?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx","html_url":"https://github.com/Functionhx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Functionhx/events{/privacy}","received_even